WEBVTT

00:00:08.786 --> 00:00:12.600
<v><b>Neighbor:</b></v> Oh, hello, Isabel. Come in!

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:16.243
We’re having a party. It’s my birthday!

00:00:16.793 --> 00:00:19.936
<v><b>Isabel:</b></v> Oh! Uh, happy birthday!

00:00:20.526 --> 00:00:23.070
<v><b>Neighbor:</b></v> Thanks. Would you like a drink?

00:00:23.651 --> 00:00:27.753
<v><b>Isabel:</b></v> Actually, I want to talk to you about the noise.

00:00:28.178 --> 00:00:28.793
<v><b>Neighbor:</b></v> Sorry?

00:00:29.356 --> 00:00:32.646
<v><b>Isabel:</b></v> The NOISE. It’s very noisy.

00:00:33.152 --> 00:00:36.113
<v><b>Neighbor:</b></v> Yes. We’re having a great time!

00:00:36.863 --> 00:00:40.023
Do you want a soda? Or a glass of iced tea?

00:00:40.522 --> 00:00:45.823
<v><b>Isabel:</b></v> Oh, well, yes, OK. A soda, please.

00:00:46.739 --> 00:00:49.716
<v><b>Neighbor:</b></v> Here you are. Come and meet my friends.

00:00:50.295 --> 00:00:55.946
Hey, everyone, say hello to Isabel. She lives next door!

00:00:56.279 --> 00:00:57.940
All: Hello, Isabel.

00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:00.566
<v><b>Isabel:</b></v> Hello.

00:01:01.185 --> 00:01:03.100
<v><b>Neighbor:</b></v> I love this song!

00:01:03.653 --> 00:01:05.426
Come and dance, Isabel…!

00:01:05.947 --> 00:01:08.213
<v><b>Isabel:</b></v> I really can’t dance.

00:01:08.626 --> 00:01:09.693
<v><b>Neighbor:</b></v> Come on…

00:01:10.227 --> 00:01:12.160
<v><b>Isabel:</b></v> Oh, OK.